@startuml
title Mediator Pattern - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "dialog:\nAuthenticationDialog" as Dialog
participant "rememberMe:\nCheckbox" as CB
participant "hiddenField:\nTextbox" as Hidden
participant "loginButton:\nButton" as Login

== Initialization ==
note over Dialog
  AuthenticationDialog creates
  all components with itself
  as mediator
end note

== User Checks "Remember Me" ==
User -> CB : check()
CB -> CB : checked = !checked
note right: Checkbox is now checked
CB -> Dialog : notify(this, "check")
Dialog -> Dialog : sender == rememberMeCheckbox?
note right: Yes, show hidden field
Dialog -> Hidden : (show hidden field)
Dialog --> User : "Mediator: Showing hidden field."

== User Clicks "Login" ==
User -> Login : click()
note right: Button 'Login' clicked.
Login -> Dialog : notify(this, "click")
Dialog -> Dialog : sender == loginButton?
note right: Yes, validate credentials
Dialog --> User : "Mediator: Validating credentials..."

@enduml
